# $apply passes string-keyed dict entries as named args to the called function.
# When the callee rejects all named arguments (E023 NamedArgRejected),
# apply raises that error rather than E022 (UnknownNamedArg, for functions
# that accept some named args but not this one).
# Note: $+ is a Tinct wrapper function; builtin-add is not in user scope.
[apply + [named: 1]]
=== error
+ does not accept named arguments (defined at 5:1-5:21)
  in apply at 5:1-5:21
  in [apply ...] at 5:1-5:21
